msgstr "每三件第三件七折"

msgid "5% off store-wide automatically added when the customer enters the cart, no code required (after applying, set the campaign start and end on the Schedule tab to avoid a permanent discount)."
msgstr "顧客進購物車自動帶入的全站 95 折,免輸入代碼(套用後到排程分頁設定活動起訖,避免變成永久折扣)。"

msgid "50 off coupon valid only for a specific payment method (after applying, choose the payment method to restrict on the \"Payment method\" tab, e.g. LINE Pay / JKOPAY)."
msgstr "限定特定付款方式才可用的折 50 券(套用後到「付款方式」分頁選擇要限定的付款方式,如 LINE Pay / 街口)。"

msgid "50 off for a specific payment method"
