msgid "A 20% off Black Friday big-sale coupon (set an expiry date when creating it to make it a limited-time coupon)."
msgstr "黑色星期五大檔 8 折券(建立時設定到期日即成限時券)。"

msgid "A 20% off coupon usable only on Saturdays and Sundays (based on the store time zone)."
msgstr "僅在週六、週日可用的 8 折券(依商店時區判定)。"

msgid "A single coupon tiered by cart amount: 10% off over 1000, 15% off over 2000, 20% off over 3000, automatically taking the highest tier."
msgstr "同一張券依購物車金額分級:滿 1000 折 10%、滿 2000 折 15%、滿 3000 折 20%,自動取最高級距。"

msgid "A total of %1$s coupon(s) used, %2$s order(s), with %3$s in cumulative discount."
msgstr "共 %1$s 張券被使用、%2$s 筆訂單,累計折抵 %3$s。"

